			"notes": "Updates the embedded cross-version stack to **ViaVersion / ViaBackwards 5.11.0** and **ViaRewind 4.1.3**.\n\n## Install\nDrop `not-enough-spectators-1.4.jar` + **Fabric API** in your `mods/` folder on a **Minecraft 26.2** Fabric profile (Java 25). Only the host needs it. Do **not** also run ViaFabric / standalone ViaVersion.\n\n## What changed\nViaBackwards 5.11.0 ships the full backwards chain for 26.2 (`26.2 → 26.1 → 1.21.11 → 1.21.9 → 1.21.7`), which is what older-version spectators need. Earlier builds bundled 5.10.x, where that conversion was incomplete and older clients failed at registry loading.\n\n**Older-client support is still unverified.** If a spectator on an older version fails to join, please open an issue with the host `logs/latest.log` and the client's `debug/disconnect-*-client.txt`.\n\nSame-version (26.2) spectating works as before.\n\n> Verify you have this build: the jar is **8,258,461 bytes**. (An earlier v1.4 upload mistakenly contained the older 5.10.x jar at 8,397,490 bytes.)\n\nGPL-3.0; bundles the GPL-3.0 Via stack (see NOTICE-Via.md)."
		},
